WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
In chess, a strong player sometimes gives a piece away.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.200
Three points down, for now —

3
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:16.550
the line opens, and two moves later nine come back.

4
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.988
Five friends, two rooms: 12 in friendships split.

5
00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:27.588
Swap one for one only. Each person's D: friends outside minus inside.

6
00:00:27.588 --> 00:00:31.788
D is what moving alone would save.

7
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.600
Swap a pair: add the two D values —

8
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.800
if they're friends, take off twice that.

9
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:50.267
Ada↔Dev: 9. Eva↔Dev: −1.

10
00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:55.313
Ada and Dev swap: 12 → 3.

11
00:00:55.313 --> 00:00:58.913
Both lock for the rest of the round.

12
00:00:58.913 --> 00:01:02.824
Still free: Eva, Ben, Cai.

13
00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:06.550
Every swap left is a loss.

14
00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:11.128
Swap anyway: Eva↔Cai, 3 → 11.

15
00:01:11.128 --> 00:01:14.128
This is only a trial.

16
00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:22.960
Look back over the round —

17
00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.160
+9 in all, then +1.

18
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.600
Keep the best prefix: step one.

19
00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:35.200
Roll back to 3.

20
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:46.700
With more people, one loss can open a door:

21
00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:49.700
−1 first, then +7.

22
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:54.900
Refusing losses stops at 7; KL gets to 1.

23
00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:02.270
Round two: all unlocked.

24
00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:06.470
−8, then −6: staying put wins.

25
00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:09.870
The empty prefix wins: stop.

26
00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:19.560
On a chip: halves of fixed size, cells swapped in pairs.

27
00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:27.500
Swap in pairs; the rooms keep their size.

28
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:33.500
Try every step, even the losses.

29
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:40.500
Then keep only the best prefix.

30
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:48.500
What if one person moves at a time? Next module.

31
00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:56.600
In the lab below, step through every trial.
